---
# Scope: infra/ansible (the pre-commit hook passes the directory explicitly).

skip_list:
  # Task/handler names here are lowercase by convention (matching the lowercase commit-subject
  # rule). Beyond churn, satisfying this rule means renaming handlers AND every `notify:` that
  # references them in lockstep -- one missed pair silently stops a handler firing (e.g. the live
  # capture service not restarting on a config change). A cosmetic rule is not worth that failure
  # mode; every other rule stays enabled.
  - name[casing]
